# Anchored to the repository root, every one of them. Without the leading
# slash, `chromium/` matches a directory of that name at any depth -- and
# `downstream/assets/chrome/app/theme/chromium/win/chromium.ico` is one, so the
# application icon was silently left out of its own commit. Every entry below
# names a top-level build or checkout directory, so anchoring them costs
# nothing and removes the whole class of accident.
/artifacts/
/chromium/
/depot_tools/
/out/
.DS_Store
*.pyc
__pycache__/
